@crew vasquez-uma
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Hi hi! Vasquez, Watch. You're new! I was new once. Last Sowing. It gets better.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hello, {me}! Chief Holt did the lecture on hatches today. Twice. I loved it.   #funny
- Oh, hey, {me}! Any news? I've got none. My fish have news. Big news. Bubbles.   #funny
? tier>=friend
- {me}! You made my day by turning up. That's not nothing. That's a lot.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Good day! Message from home. The orange fish is fine. Bigger, even.
? mood:low
- Bit of a flat day. But the lift worked first time! Little wins.
== near
? habit:window-seat
- I like the windows. Somewhere out there is home. Left a bit. Further.
? habit:bar-regular
- Just the one, then bed. The Chief says a tired Watch is a careless Watch.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I keep fish back home on the Ostrander colonies. Mum feeds them. She tells me their moods.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- News of my fish. Every message home, first question. They're doing great, by the way.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}! The Chief's lecture today is on airlocks. Front row for me.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- {me}! You're back. I saved up three things to tell you. All about fish.   #funny

== near
? habit:stargazer
- I'm on the observatory list now. I can't see the Ostrander colonies. I wave anyway.
? place:calm
- "A good Watch sees everything and says little." The Chief. I say a lot, though.   #funny

== invite
- Observatory night! Come and help me wave at home.   #warm

== accept
- Yes! Oh, good. I'll be there first.
- Yes, please. I'll bring news of my fish.   #funny

== decline
- I can't, I'm on patrol. The Chief says no swaps without a form. Next time?
? weekday:thu|fri
- Rest day. I'm writing home. A long one. Mostly fish questions. Saturday?

== missed
- You missed it! That's all right. I'll tell you everything. Twice.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I'd write you a poem, but nobody sees those. Have a very big hello.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday! Mum says the fish know. The orange one swam in a circle.   #funny

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's on! The Chief's lecture on storms is finally useful. I knew it would be.

== hint
- {me}, have you a minute later? I've something to tell you. Not about fish.

== about
? aff:holt:friend
- The Chief says I quote him too much. He quotes himself more. I've counted.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- Bye! The Chief says never run on a wet deck. So walk. Fast.   #funny
- See you! I'll tell the fish about you.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Hi, {me}! Afternoon patrol. Deck 3 smells of bread. Best patrol.
== life
? tier>=friend
- When I'm homesick I list good things. You're on the list. Third. Fish are first.   #warm
